MODULE types_v2

Define configuration settings for the base directory, profile, state paths,
offline mode, download limit, extraction limit, and request timeout.

Define platform as operating-system name plus CPU architecture.

Define package manifest, platform asset, profile, resolved package, lockfile,
installation receipt, package-health result, offline-pack manifest, application
paths, runtime dependencies, and setting explanation exactly as described in
SPEC.md.

Use concrete function, clock, HTTP client, stream, string, integer, boolean,
list, and record types. Do not allow an untyped escape value at module
boundaries.
